</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcane projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shockwaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dragon rage abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own playstyle by combining magic and melee combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐺 <strong>COMPANIONS WHO FIGHT BY YOUR SIDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not travel alone. Your companions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >assist you in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >react to the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >comment on events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grow stronger alongside you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 <strong>A WORLD BUILT WITH UNREAL ENGINE 5</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >abandoned crypts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dark forests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ruined villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ancient ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >snow-covered mountain passes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area is filled with secrets, enemies, and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>CHARACTER PROGRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by improving:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >intelligence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endurance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapon skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, upgrade your gear, and adapt to an ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>QUESTS AND SECRETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ancient dragon legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the origins of the undead uprising</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the secrets of your own bloodline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the story and the fate of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠 <strong>DEVELOPED BY A SOLO CREATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created entirely by one developer with passion and attention to every visual and gameplay detail.<br>A demo is available now — try it and help shape the game’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Action RPG with a realistic combat system<br>🐉 Play as a dragon hiding in human form<br>🔥 Devastating magic and spectacular spells<br>🧟 Hordes of undead, bosses, and deadly enemies<br>🤝 Combat companions<br>🌄 A beautiful world powered by Unreal Engine 5<br>📈 Deep character progression system<br>🕯 Atmospheric crypts, ruins, and dark forests<br>🎮 Demo available now<br>🛠 Developed by a solo developer</p>",
